{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an <strong>Odyssey</strong>, through a captivating 2D RPG set in a hand-drawn world ravaged by the absence of its god-like creators. Play as Codrin, an unwitting mage, who journeys through the post-apocalyptic realm of Dremid'ir, mastering volatile magic, confronting unimaginable creatures, and exploring diverse landscapes \u2014 from ruined cities to deep caverns, to alien worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">KEY FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/8ed9a754d6454c047ebf6b1954477613.poster.avif?t=1772055791\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/8ed9a754d6454c047ebf6b1954477613.webm?t=1772055791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Forge an Unlikely Alliance:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Odyssey is a heavily story and character driven adventure, bringing together unlikely friends, from novice sorcerers, angelic knights, and even dangerous scavengers together on a journey to save the city-state of Bastion -- and perhaps even the entire world.  <br><br><br><strong>A City to Live for:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city of New Bastion, home to over a dozen characters with their own stories, comings and goings. Use the city's &quot;Forge&quot; mechanic to create powerful weapons. Becoming closer with the townsfolk will give you the opportunity to go on hand crafted quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/04e3746c326415cc225cc5e0ed0d5c86.poster.avif?t=1772055791\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/04e3746c326415cc225cc5e0ed0d5c86.webm?t=1772055791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Personalized Character Progression:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your characters with precise attribute and skill point allocation. The unfolding narrative responds to your choices of companions, adding layers to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic and Tactical Combat:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in seamless combat where enemies roam freely. Combine party members strategically, exploiting their synergies. Outsmart foes who adapt and plan, and rise to the occasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/c985f03692ee53f6d3448a329b8113a4.poster.avif?t=1772055791\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/c985f03692ee53f6d3448a329b8113a4.webm?t=1772055791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Perilous Open World Exploration:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the Ruins of the Old World, confronting mutant monsters, and more. Engage in quests that evolve characters and unravel the world's mysteries. Unearth hidden treasures by deciphering ancient notes and maps, and revealing the secrets within.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2134530?t=1772055791","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772055791","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/538e1685fe8a83e7b51f363cab381ddbd036ec1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772055791","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/538e1685fe8a83e7b51f363cab381ddbd036ec1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772055791","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2419160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an <strong>Odyssey</strong>, through a captivating 2D RPG set in a hand-drawn world ravaged by the absence of its god-like creators. Play as Codrin, an unwitting mage, who journeys through the post-apocalyptic realm of Dremid'ir, mastering volatile magic, confronting unimaginable creatures, and exploring diverse landscapes \u2014 from ruined cities to deep caverns, to alien worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">KEY FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/8ed9a754d6454c047ebf6b1954477613.poster.avif?t=1772055791\" width=800 height=