raph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic and Tactical Combat:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in seamless combat where enemies roam freely. Combine party members strategically, exploiting their synergies. Outsmart foes who adapt and plan, and rise to the occasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/c985f03692ee53f6d3448a329b8113a4.poster.avif?t=1772055791\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/c985f03692ee53f6d3448a329b8113a4.webm?t=1772055791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Perilous Open World Exploration:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the Ruins of the Old World, confronting mutant monsters, and more. Engage in quests that evolve characters and unravel the world's mysteries. Unearth hidden treasures by deciphering ancient notes and maps, and revealing the secrets within.</p>","developers":["Chiaroscuro Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/e72f328fc6e4a3daff8ea99305e9247c39643da4/header.jpg?t=1772055791","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134530/1268199086/bb835e563458e8b1e11bbcbd98306476b2e23a8d/1758053997/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758856308","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134530/1268199086/bb835e563458e8b1e11bbcbd98306476b2e23a8d/1758053997/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758856308","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/213453